hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"211","Ahmad ibn Abdah informed us, Sufyan informed us, on the authority of Abdullah ibn Dinar, on the authority of Ibn Umar, on the authority of Umar, that he asked the Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace Peace and blessings of God be upon him: Can one of us sleep while he is junub? He said: “He sleeps and performs ablution if he wishes.”"
"212","Saeed bin Abdul-Rahman Al-Makhzoumi narrated it, Sufyan narrated it with this chain of transmission, and he said: Omar bin Al-Khattab asked the Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace Peace and blessings of God be upon him: Can one of us sleep while he is junub? He said: “If he wants to sleep, let him perform ablution.”"
